"Your account has been created, but an error occurred while setting your "
"password (%(message)s). You may need to change it after logging in."
msgstr ""
"您的帳戶已建立，但在設定密碼時發生錯誤 (%(message)s)。您可能需要在登入後更改"
"密碼。"

